  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Waterless textile dying, Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A DGGF loan will support the Dutch SME company CleanDye in setting up a textile dyeing factory in Vietnam. In the factory, (polyester) textiles will be dyed in a cost-saving and environmentally friendly  way without using water.The dyed textile will be sold to retailers, mostly active in Europe.</narrative>
  </description>
